WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 2, Scene 14h: Adel containment satellites destroyed
Duration: ~7 seconds
Source: FF8 FMV — orbital seal failure

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
Angular containment satellites orbit in space, pink energy beams streaming between their panels.

00:03.500 --> 00:07.000
